OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Sally
OL,6,G     Beamish
OL,7,     F2/5. Donald Macleod and Sally
OL,8,     FBeamish delve into her student
OL,9,     Fyears, travels and early
OL,10,     Fprofessional career.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FKatie Derham is joined in the In
OL,13,     FTune studio by the Zoe Rahman
OL,14,     FTrio, who play tracks from their
OL,15,     Flatest album, 'Hull Suite', which
OL,16,     Fwas recently released.
OL,17,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,18,     FLive at the BBC Proms: Daniel
OL,19,     FBartholomew-Poyser conducts the
OL,20,     FBBC Concert Orchestra in music
OL,21,     Ffrom the iconic spy thriller
OL,22,     Ffilms.
